From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Asahi Lina <lina@asahilina.net>
Date: Sat, 11 Feb 2023 16:59:20 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] rust: drm: syncobj: Add DRM Sync Object abstraction

DRM Sync Objects are a container for a DMA fence, and can be waited on
signaled, exported, and imported from userspace. Add a Rust abstraction
so Rust DRM drivers can support this functionality.

Signed-off-by: Asahi Lina <lina@asahilina.net>
(cherry picked from commit 2bf9aa2d0086bfe0d21310d7ec9ef52b6be14a0a)
[Youwes09: use mainline's dma_fence and carry FenceChain here]
Signed-off-by: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
---
